  data: {
    LLM: 'Prioritize playing two tiles that keep both ends of the line flexible; avoid leaving a single suit dominant on one end.\n\nCount suits; know which pip values are likely unavailable on the ends. If the lead was 3-4, 3 and 4 may be scarce. Decide when to call blocked game to maximize opponent penalty.\n\nStrategize so both ends change each play; use suit counting to force blocks when it benefits you. Call blocked game to keep scores lower when advantageous.',
    Player: 'Prioritize playing two tiles that keep both ends of the line flexible; avoid leaving a single suit dominant on one end.\n\nCount suits; know which pip values are likely unavailable on the ends. If the lead was 3-4, 3 and 4 may be scarce. Decide when to call blocked game to maximize opponent penalty.\n\nStrategize so both ends change each play; use suit counting to force blocks when it benefits you. Call blocked game to keep scores lower when advantageous.',
